{\b\fs22 AniSync}\par
\par
An app that updates your AniList or MyAnimeList list automatically when you finish an episode.\par
\par
\bullet\~AniSync reads the titles of videos and windows playing on this PC, only to recognize the anime and the episode.\par
\bullet\~Only the detected title is looked up online: on AniList, and on Wikidata to translate a French title AniList doesn't know. Your progress is only sent to your list's site (AniList or MyAnimeList), once your account is connected.\par
\bullet\~Listening can be turned off at any time with the "Listening" switch.\par
\bullet\~Installed for your Windows account only, without administrator rights. Uninstall from Settings > Apps.\par
\par
AniSync is not affiliated with AniList or MyAnimeList. Software provided as is, without warranty.\par
